picows licensing

LICENSE.txt is the GNU General Public License version 3. It covers the picows
library sources and headers:

- include/picows/
- src/ws.cpp, src/http.c, src/http_parse.c, src/http_parse.h, src/core_internal.h,
  src/usb_identity.h, src/mbedtls_compat/
- examples/ws_echo/
- tests/http_parse_test.c

Other trees keep their own notices:

- src/ (TinyUSB, except the picows files named above) and src/usb_descriptors.c: MIT
- lib/lwip: BSD-3-Clause
- lib/networking: the license headers in those files
- submodules/pico-ws-server: MIT
- submodules/pico-sdk: BSD-3-Clause

The WebSocket handshake uses the small SHA-1 and Base64 in src/mbedtls_compat
instead of Mbed TLS.
